{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mlops-evolution-landscape","title":"MLOps 演进与生态全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/mlops-evolution-landscape","wordCount":1382,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"ml-system-design-principles","title":"ML 系统设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/ml-system-design-principles","wordCount":1265,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-model-assessment","title":"MLOps 成熟度模型与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/foundations/maturity-model-assessment","wordCount":1330,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础篇\">基础篇</h1><p>本章建立 MLOps 平台工程的认知框架。从行业演进轨迹出发，理解为什么&quot;把模型扔到生产&quot;这件事需要一整套工程体系；然后深入 ML 系统设计的独特原则——数据依赖、实验可复现、训练-服务一致性；最后通过成熟度模型为你的团队定位当前阶段与演进方向。</p>\n<p>三篇文档形成递进关系：先看全景（演进与生态）→ 再理解核心设计约束（系统原则）→ 最后对标定位（成熟度评估）。</p>\n"}